    {
      "id": "2121697251819229393",
      "author": "elonmusk",
      "author_name": "Elon Musk",
      "author_avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2053244804520427520/m8mdWZCG_200x200.jpg",
      "author_verified": true,
      "author_verified_type": "individual",
      "created_at_utc": "2026-11-14T20:10:18.000Z",
      "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-15 04:10:18",
      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "Grok Bot has been such a force multiplier for me. It’s insane. \n\nIt provides you with a team of experts, and you get a totally customizable assistant. It replaces tools like search. It enhances applications like a CRM.\n\nIt works on every device, so you can now do real work from your phone, then pick it up on your laptop or desktop. I often have 3 to 5 bots working on things simultaneously. \n\nIf you have not tried it, use it for one month. It will blow you away. If already love it, share this message. Everyone that I get to use Grok Bot has become a total fan and feels the same way. \n\nI know the team, and they are working relentlessly around the clock to make the product do everything and anything that you need.",
      "quote": null,
      "retweet": {
        "author": "adeoressi",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2024154894253563904/wWs4lGeb_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-15 01:48:40",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-11-14T17:48:40.000Z",
        "id": "2121661606824419580",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Adeo Ressi",
        "text": "Grok Bot has been such a force multiplier for me. It’s insane. \n\nIt provides you with a team of experts, and you get a totally customizable assistant. It replaces tools like search. It enhances applications like a CRM.\n\nIt works on every device, so you can now do real work from your phone, then pick it up on your laptop or desktop. I often have 3 to 5 bots working on things simultaneously. \n\nIf you have not tried it, use it for one month. It will blow you away. If already love it, share this message. Everyone that I get to use Grok Bot has become a total fan and feels the same way. \n\nI know the team, and they are working relentlessly around the clock to make the product do everything and anything that you need.",
